\par \pard\plain \s0\ql\widctlpar\ltrpar\sl276\slmult1{\*\hyphen2\hyphlead2\hyphtrail2\hyphmax0}\sb0\sa200\cf0\hich\af11\langfe1033\dbch\af10\afs22\lang1025\loch\f4\fs21\lang1033{\rtlch \ltrch\loch
Determine whether C is invariant or depends on arbitrary coordinates.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\ql\widctlpar\ltrpar\sl276\slmult1{\*\hyphen2\hyphlead2\hyphtrail2\hyphmax0}\sb0\sa200\cf0\hich\af11\langfe1033\dbch\af10\afs22\lang1025\loch\f4\fs21\lang1033{\rtlch \ltrch\loch
Fit identical observations with GR and EMRF under identical assumptions.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\ql\widctlpar\ltrpar\sl276\slmult1{\*\hyphen2\hyphlead2\hyphtrail2\hyphmax0}\sb0\sa200\cf0\hich\af11\langfe1033\dbch\af10\afs22\lang1025\loch\f4\fs21\lang1033{\rtlch \ltrch\loch
Penalize additional free parameters rather than rewarding them automatically.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\ql\widctlpar\ltrpar\sl276\slmult1{\*\hyphen2\hyphlead2\hyphtrail2\hyphmax0}\sb0\sa200\cf0\hich\af11\langfe1033\dbch\af10\afs22\lang1025\loch\f4\fs21\lang1033{\rtlch \ltrch\loch
Use out-of-sample trajectories or observations for validation.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\ql\widctlpar\ltrpar\sl276\slmult1{\*\hyphen2\hyphlead2\hyphtrail2\hyphmax0}\sb0\sa200\cf0\hich\af11\langfe1033\dbch\af10\afs22\lang1025\loch\f4\fs21\lang1033{\rtlch \ltrch\loch
Propagate measurement and model uncertainty.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\ql\widctlpar\ltrpar\sl276\slmult1{\*\hyphen2\hyphlead2\hyphtrail2\hyphmax0}\sb0\sa200\cf0\hich\af11\langfe1033\dbch\af10\afs22\lang1025\loch\f4\fs21\lang1033{\rtlch \ltrch\loch
Construct counterexamples where the proposed causal chain fails.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\ql\widctlpar\ltrpar\sl276\slmult1{\*\hyphen2\hyphlead2\hyphtrail2\hyphmax0}\sb0\sa200\cf0\hich\af11\langfe1033\dbch\af10\afs22\lang1025\loch\f4\fs21\lang1033{\rtlch \ltrch\loch
