\par \pard\plain \s0\ql\widctlpar\ltrpar\sl276\slmult1{\*\hyphen2\hyphlead2\hyphtrail2\hyphmax0}\sb0\sa200\cf0\hich\af11\langfe1033\dbch\af10\afs22\lang1025\loch\f4\fs21\lang1033{\rtlch \ltrch\loch
The VS Code project and associated .nexus/MCP agent infrastructure can orchestrate public observational-data acquisition, normalization, simulation, baseline reproduction, candidate calculations, provenance, and independent critique. Agency does not substitute for scientific validation.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\ql\widctlpar\ltrpar\sl276\slmult1{\*\hyphen2\hyphlead2\hyphtrail2\hyphmax0}\sb0\sa200\cf0\hich\af11\langfe1033\dbch\af10\afs22\lang1025\loch\f4\fs21\lang1033{\rtlch \ltrch\loch
Recommended pipeline: acquisition \u8594\'3f provenance \u8594\'3f normalization \u8594\'3f baseline reproduction \u8594\'3f candidate C construction \u8594\'3f model comparison \u8594\'3f residual analysis \u8594\'3f independent replication \u8594\'3f report generation.}
