The framework is a speculative theoretical research program. The conceptual architecture is sufficiently developed to formulate explicit mathematical and observational tests, but the available record does not establish empirical validation.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\ql\widctlpar\ltrpar\sl276\slmult1{\*\hyphen2\hyphlead2\hyphtrail2\hyphmax0}\sb0\sa200\cf0\hich\af11\langfe1033\dbch\af10\afs22\lang1025\loch\f4\fs21\lang1033{\rtlch \ltrch\loch
